          "text": "[Organically Linked Formula] Fights in concert with <Structural Principle>. When shield is broken or HP is reduced to 0, <Structural Principle> is stunned, and [Reactive Defense Module] is temporarily disabled.",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Concentration Algorithm] Locks onto a target and bombards it, dealing Physical damage to it and units in the 8 surrounding tiles several times",
          "format": "normal"
        }
